P00 command record (paths normalized)

Package validation:
python3 <instruction-package>/tools/validate_instruction_package.py <instruction-package>
shasum -a 256 -c <instruction-package>/SHA256SUMS.txt

Reference audit reproduction:
python3 <copied-reference-audit>/ash_reference_pipeline_audit.py --json-out reference-audit-reproduced.json --markdown-out reference-audit-reproduced.md

Debug build:
xcodebuild -project Mirmir.xcodeproj -scheme Mirmir -configuration Debug -destination platform=macOS,arch=arm64 -derivedDataPath /tmp/mirmir-p00-deriveddata -onlyUsePackageVersionsFromResolvedFile -skipPackageUpdates -resultBundlePath <run>/debug-build.xcresult clean build

Focused ASH tests:
xcodebuild -project Mirmir.xcodeproj -scheme Mirmir -configuration Debug -destination platform=macOS,arch=arm64 -derivedDataPath /tmp/mirmir-p00-deriveddata -onlyUsePackageVersionsFromResolvedFile -skipPackageUpdates -enableCodeCoverage YES -only-testing:MirmirTests/ASHAssetTests -only-testing:MirmirTests/ASHBackendTests -only-testing:MirmirTests/ASHBitwiseTests -only-testing:MirmirTests/ASHFeatureTests -only-testing:MirmirTests/ASHInternalTests -resultBundlePath <run>/focused-ash-tests.xcresult test

Full Debug tests:
xcodebuild -project Mirmir.xcodeproj -scheme Mirmir -configuration Debug -destination platform=macOS,arch=arm64 -derivedDataPath /tmp/mirmir-p00-deriveddata -onlyUsePackageVersionsFromResolvedFile -skipPackageUpdates -enableCodeCoverage YES -resultBundlePath <run>/full-debug-tests.xcresult test

Release build:
xcodebuild -project Mirmir.xcodeproj -scheme Mirmir -configuration Release -destination platform=macOS,arch=arm64 -derivedDataPath /tmp/mirmir-p00-release-deriveddata -onlyUsePackageVersionsFromResolvedFile -skipPackageUpdates -resultBundlePath <run>/release-build.xcresult clean build

App launch verification:
CONFIGURATION=Debug ./script/build_and_run.sh --verify

Integrity verification:
shasum -a 256 -c <run>/baseline-source.sha256
shasum -a 256 -c <run>/input-media.sha256
